  "solution": "The logic followed here is :-\n\n**(First number × ((First number × 2) + 2)) + 1 = Second number**\n\n__\n \n• 7 : 113 → (7 × ((7 × 2) + 2)) + 1 = (7 × (14 + 2)) + 1 = (7 × 16) + 1 = 112 + 1 = 113\n \n• **11 : ? → (11 × ((11 × 2) + 2)) + 1 = (11 × (22 + 2)) + 1 = (11 × 24) + 1 = 264 + 1 = 265**\n \n• 15 : 481 → (15 × ((15 × 2) + 2)) + 1 = (15 × (30 + 2)) + 1 = (15 × 32) + 1 = 480 + 1 = 481\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"265\".**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c76c13ba2d2ab46b47f8a931ae621dac081a0cb266b142dc23f58659fac4a466.png] **Alternate Method__**7² + 8²\n\n⇒ 49 + 64 = 113\n\n15² + 16²\n\n⇒ 225 + 256\n\n**Similarly**\n\n11² + 12²\n\n⇒ 121 + 144 = 265",
